# Synthetic QEMU memory-region trace in the oracle's line format.
#
# This file is ours and carries no oracle output and no device data: it is a boot-shaped
# sequence written by hand over the register offsets of the c3_devices! blocks, so the coverage
# gate and the ingest have a sample to run on with no oracle present.
# The pairing file hist-sample.hist is the histogram it must produce.

